cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this MCP server, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: Wildfire Flood MCP Server
abstract: >-
  MCP server for the wildfire-to-flood cascade. For a burned area it measures
  burn severity from Sentinel-2, finds steep burned slopes and nearby buildings
  (Copernicus DEM, ESA WorldCover), and checks whether past or forecast rain
  (Open-Meteo) crosses the USGS M1 debris-flow threshold (Staley et al. 2017).
  It chains with the EFFIS server.
